{
  "document_id": "legacy/story/89c3da909b32/ch25",
  "extensions": {
    "legacy": {
      "chapter": 25,
      "location": "飛行岩墜落在惡魔之山的熔岩洞窟中,途中先目睹龍人族之王聖寇拉斯獨自對峙火魔神(惡魔族之王卡爾根的化身/傀儡)。眾人及時馳援,合力擊退火魔神,救出聖寇拉斯,並與惡魔族王弟亞奇梅吉相遇——亞奇梅吉揭露惡魔族其實是被邪法操控利用,自願加入隊伍帶路前往古代人遺跡與黃金城。",
      "notes": "本章代碼「G」在腳本中交替代表兩位角色:聖寇拉斯(陛下,先前無專屬肖像代碼)與凱拉斯,依內文點名與稱謂(「陛下」「龍人族之長」等)逐句判別歸屬,已於下方逐行標註;「大」為惡魔族之王卡爾根被操控後化身的火魔神,「克」「威」為未附全名的次要角色(疑為惡魔族/龍人族部下),均依原始單字代號直書,標記 speaker=-1。首句「H:是誰..打擾了我的睡眠」內容與後續「大」的自白語氣一致,疑為同一角色(火魔神甦醒瞬間)的顯示代碼異常,已併入「大」處理,標記 [?]。",
      "source_dat": "FDTXT_025",
      "title": "第二十五章 — 熔岩洞窟激戰,巧遇龍人王聖寇拉斯"
    }
  },
  "kind": "story",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "火魔神甦醒,聖寇拉斯獨自對峙"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "note": "[?] 原始代碼顯示為 H(米亞斯多德),依語氣判斷應為火魔神「大」甦醒獨白,已合併歸屬",
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "大"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/0/lines/0",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/89c3da909b32/scenes/0/lines/0",
          "text": "是誰...打擾了我的睡眠...!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "大"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/0/lines/1",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/89c3da909b32/scenes/0/lines/1",
          "text": "果然不愧是龍人族之長,終於讓你找到這裡了!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 26,
              "speaker_name": "聖寇拉斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/0/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-26",
          "text": "你竟敢利用惡魔族來逞一己的野心私欲,實在是不可原諒!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "大"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/0/lines/3",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/89c3da909b32/scenes/0/lines/3",
          "text": "惡魔族本來就是我們創造的,要如何使用他們是我們的事!而且,你既然知道了這些事,我就不會讓你活著離開這裡..."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 26,
              "speaker_name": "聖寇拉斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/0/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-26",
          "text": "我手下的援軍馬上就趕到了,今天要讓你看看龍人族戰士的力量...!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "大"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/0/lines/5",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/89c3da909b32/scenes/0/lines/5",
          "text": "真驚人的聲勢,你到底派來了什麼援軍?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 26,
              "speaker_name": "聖寇拉斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/0/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-26",
          "text": "這..好像不是.."
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/89c3da909b32/scenes/0"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "飛行岩迫降,索爾一行趕到"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/1/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "終於停了.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 3,
              "speaker_name": "哈瓦特"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/1/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-3",
          "text": "嗚..真爛的著陸法!還沒和敵人交戰就摔掉半條命了..."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/1/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "悠妮,悠妮!妳沒有受傷吧?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 9,
              "speaker_name": "悠妮"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/1/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-9",
          "text": "還好,一點傷都沒有..索爾你也還好吧?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/1/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "哼..差別待遇喔!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/1/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "別吵了,大家都沒事吧!這裡好像就是敵方的根據地之一,我們要特別小心.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 16,
              "speaker_name": "凱拉斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/1/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-16",
          "text": "咦!那邊有人在對峙著..好像有我們一族的龍人呢!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 27,
              "speaker_name": "巴拿羅西亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/1/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-27",
          "text": "真的?那陛下一定在裡面!聖寇拉斯陛下!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 26,
              "speaker_name": "聖寇拉斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/1/lines/8",
          "speaker": "character/native-26",
          "text": "有人認識我嗎?啊!是巴拿羅西亞和凱拉斯!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 16,
              "speaker_name": "凱拉斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/1/lines/9",
          "speaker": "character/native-16",
          "text": "陛下,我們總算找到您了!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/1/lines/10",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "聖寇拉斯,好久不見了,沒想到會和你在這裡會師!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 26,
              "speaker_name": "聖寇拉斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/1/lines/11",
          "speaker": "character/native-26",
          "text": "啊!原來是約拿先生,好極啦,有你手下這批生力軍,這下子就沒問題了!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "大"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/1/lines/12",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/89c3da909b32/scenes/1/lines/12",
          "text": "哼,果然是你找來的援軍沒錯,你們都準備死在這裡吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/1/lines/13",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "這怪傢伙還真囂張,亞雷斯,我們合力宰了他!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/1/lines/14",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "對!送他去和他的前三個伙伴相會!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "大"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/1/lines/15",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/89c3da909b32/scenes/1/lines/15",
          "text": "什麼!難道..難道地水風三個魔神都已經被你們打倒了?可惡,我火魔神要替他們一併把這筆血債討回來!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/1/lines/16",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "少囉唆!有種就放馬過來吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 26,
              "speaker_name": "聖寇拉斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/1/lines/17",
          "speaker": "character/native-26",
          "text": "約拿..你要代替我..打倒這幫傢伙,要不然..這世界會..."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "克"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/1/lines/18",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/89c3da909b32/scenes/1/lines/18",
          "text": "..可惡,主人不會放過你們的..到時候你們就會和這世界一起毀滅...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/1/lines/19",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/89c3da909b32/scenes/1/lines/19",
          "text": "聖寇拉斯陛下,我們來遲了!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 26,
              "speaker_name": "聖寇拉斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/1/lines/20",
          "speaker": "character/native-26",
          "text": "還不晚,先把火魔神打倒再說吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/1/lines/21",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/89c3da909b32/scenes/1/lines/21",
          "text": "遵命!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/89c3da909b32/scenes/1"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "戰後重逢,亞奇梅吉請纓帶路"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 26,
              "speaker_name": "聖寇拉斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/2/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-26",
          "text": "真是驚險的一戰!約拿老頭,你從哪裡找來這些生力軍?如果沒有他們,這一戰的結果就會改觀了。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/2/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "他們是一群富正義感的年輕勇士,因為機緣巧合同聚一堂,之後為了打倒暗中威脅這整個大陸的敵人而和我一起奮戰至今。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 26,
              "speaker_name": "聖寇拉斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/2/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-26",
          "text": "好極了,我正愁來不及召集一支夠強的軍隊!據我調查的結果,這熔岩洞窟中有通道通往一個古代人的遺跡,據說從那裡可以直達黃金的城堡。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/2/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "所謂黃金的城堡,就是指敵人的根據地嗎?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/2/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "很難說,我們要去確認之後才知道。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 26,
              "speaker_name": "聖寇拉斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/2/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-26",
          "text": "敵人似乎怕我們發現這一點,所以剛才那傢伙企圖施用魔法讓火山爆發,徹底毀滅這條通道,但這樣也會毀了惡魔族的棲息之地..幸好你們及時抵達,才沒有讓那傢伙得逞。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/2/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "好極了,咱們趕快前往遺跡吧,這次絕不能再讓敵人搶先了!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 29,
              "speaker_name": "亞奇梅吉"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/2/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-29",
          "text": "等等!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/2/lines/8",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "咦,敵方還有漏網之魚嗎?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 29,
              "speaker_name": "亞奇梅吉"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/2/lines/9",
          "speaker": "character/native-29",
          "text": "別誤會,我是來加入你們一行的。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/2/lines/10",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "你會說人類的語言?這可有趣了。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 29,
              "speaker_name": "亞奇梅吉"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/2/lines/11",
          "speaker": "character/native-29",
          "text": "我是當今惡魔族之王卡爾根的弟弟,王家魔法師亞奇梅吉。我平日對人類和大陸上的其他種族有很深的研究,所以通曉你們的語言。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/2/lines/12",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "你的種族剛剛才聯合火魔神與我們為敵,為何現在你又要加入我們?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 29,
              "speaker_name": "亞奇梅吉"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/2/lines/13",
          "speaker": "character/native-29",
          "text": "我族並不是故意要與你們為敵,因為敵人以邪法控制了王兄的神智,藉以命令我族的戰士來抵擋你們的攻勢。我看穿這一點之後,敵人便假王兄之手將我監禁起來,還好你們阻止了他們,不然整個惡魔族可能會就此滅亡。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/2/lines/14",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "原來如此,你對敵人的所知有多少?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 29,
              "speaker_name": "亞奇梅吉"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/2/lines/15",
          "speaker": "character/native-29",
          "text": "我相信他們和古代人的遺跡以及黃金城絕對有關連,他們可能是從附近的遺跡來到這個世界的,所以當務之急是經由本地的通道前往遺跡,以免他們再度增援。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 26,
              "speaker_name": "聖寇拉斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/89c3da909b32/scenes/2/lines/16",
          "speaker": "character/native-26",
          "text": "好極了,那接下來便由你來帶路了。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 29,
              "speaker_name": "亞奇梅吉"
            }
